WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.000
Film how an object works.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
SAM finds its parts. SAM 3D gives them shape.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Keep their connections and source evidence.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.800
Place the case.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.300
Open the case.

6
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:21.000
Move both earbuds to the tray.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.600
Then close it.

8
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.000
Find the parts your agent needs.

9
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.000
Match their interfaces across recordings.

10
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.000
Prepare a source-linked task draft.

11
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.700
Real demonstrations. Reusable interactions.

12
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Interaction Twin.


13
00:00:45.400 --> 00:01:02.500
Now explore the application. The public demo includes five owner-recorded examples. Expand a card to compare its video and connected replay, inspect individual parts, and download original models and descriptive files.

14
00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:20.500
The object program keeps more than shape. It links parts, estimated joint frames, axes, angles, removable relationships and demonstrated steps to source evidence. Unknown physical properties remain explicit.

15
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:34.600
Muse proposes parts and actions. Separate critic prompts use the same Muse model, alongside code checks. Up to two repair rounds can follow, then the owner approves. Feedback becomes guidance for later runs.

16
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:47.600
Copy the connection guide into your agent. The local read-only M C P server exposes the same curated library: search, inspect descriptions, retrieve geometry, and follow source evidence.

17
00:01:48.300 --> 00:02:02.600
This saved client made forty-two M C P calls across phone and charger recordings. It checked six native models and nine source images, then prepared a five-step task draft. A separate Muse critique flags unresolved compatibility.

18
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:28.900
The browser robot makes the handoff visible. This full rehearsal places the case, opens the connected lid, moves both earbuds onto their goals, then closes the case and withdraws. You can edit supported instructions locally and export the typed task. These are authored kinematics, not simulated grasp forces, trained control or physical robot execution.

19
00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:49.600
Meta Muse proposes parts and actions. SAM three point one segments them; SAM three D drafts meshes. Our Python code builds source-linked object programs and manages checks, review and approval. Read-only M C P and Three J S viewers make those programs reusable.

20
00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:59.700
Next, validate physical scale and contact. Reuse the evidence. Build the next interaction. Interaction Twin.

